docker/skills
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Upstream:  https://github.com/docker/skills (commit 3e1cbd179989c2c193f3e4e6553a655907c2003b)
Licence:   Apache License 2.0
Copyright: Copyright 2026 Docker, Inc.

Four skills were adapted into artifacts in this catalog. The upstream repository
also contains seven others that were deliberately not taken: the three
`docker-agent-*` skills and the four `docker-sandboxes-*` skills, which cover
Docker's own Docker Agent and `sbx` products rather than general container work.

Changes made (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): these artifacts are modified versions, not
copies. The upstream skills were rewritten as prose that explains why each rule
holds, and re-aimed at Python data projects, so the examples are Python images,
Airflow and dbt stacks and Postgres rather than Go, Node.js and web applications.
Material specific to npm registry credentials was replaced with handling for a
private PyPI index and dbt `profiles.yml`. Upstream's helper scripts, asset files,
per-skill manifests, evaluation runbooks and agent-specific configuration were not
carried over. Upstream's trigger conditions in the SKILL.md frontmatter were
re-expressed as catalog metadata (`applies_to`, `strength`, `topics`). Content
was added that upstream does not contain, including the Airflow Compose example,
the dbt and private-index credential cases, and the example confirmation wording.
Upstream publishes no NOTICE file of its own.

