Licence:   none published; included with the author's permission (issue #57)

One skill was adapted into an artifact in this catalog.

Adaptation was not a verbatim copy. The upstream skill was written on a
Dataform, BigQuery and Dagster project. Its general rules - where each fact goes,
what a comment on a check says, what stays out of the code, and keeping comments
true - were rewritten as prose that explains why each rule holds, with neutral
