in "Keep comments true". Upstream's trigger conditions in the SKILL.md
frontmatter were re-expressed as catalog metadata (`applies_to`, `strength`,
`topics`). The substance of the rules - the placement table, the requirement
that a check's failure case be true of the code, what stays out of a comment,
and the Dataform specifics - is the author's.

